<title>USA: Coca-Cola Bottling names Harrison chairman.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Bottling names Harrison chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Bottling Co Consolidated said Wednesday that J. Frank Harrison III has been named chief executive and board chairman.</p>
<p>Harrison succeeds his father, J. Frank Harrison Jr, who retired after two decades as chairman, the company said.  </p>
<p>The company said Harrison Jr. will continue to serve on its board.</p>
<p>The Charlotte-based firm is the nation's second largest Coca-Cola bottler, with 5,000 employees and franchise bottling operations across twelve southeastern states.</p>
</text>
